# Everything downloaded or unpacked at install time stays out of the repo:
#   downloads/  knulli images, SDL2 tarballs, app archives
#   state/      per-VM config (contains the VNC password), app registry
#   padenv/     host venv for pad_bridge.py (pip-installed)
downloads/
state/
padenv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
bin/
# Maintainer notes (architecture rationale, measurement history, traps) stay
# local by request — the README is the only doc that ships.
INTERNALS.md
